      <p class="tl-company"><a href="https://github.com/Supercomputing-System-AI-Lab" target="_blank">Supercomputing System and AI Lab</a>, UIUC · <a href="https://minjiazhang.github.io/" target="_blank">Prof. Minjia Zhang</a></p>
      <p class="tl-meta">Oct 2024 - Mar 2025 · Remote</p>
      <p class="tl-desc">Extended <a href="https://github.com/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/blob/master/blogs/deepspeed-chat/README.md" target="_blank">DeepSpeed-Chat</a>, whose RLHF pipeline shipped with PPO only, to preference-based post-training. Built a <strong>DPO trainer</strong> that scores chosen and rejected responses against a reference policy with adaptive KL control, trainable with LoRA, added a <strong>best-of-N rejection-sampling</strong> variant, and extended the preference-data pipeline to feed both. Runs on DeepSpeed's <strong>hybrid engine</strong> and <strong>ZeRO</strong>.</p>
      <p class="tl-pubs-label">Code</p>
